Follow @AGENTS.md and @frontend/AGENTS.md.

Key frontend constraints:
- Strict TypeScript; avoid `any` and validate external payloads at boundaries.
- UI never implements Strategy/Risk decisions.
- WebSocket is realtime transport, not truth; resync authoritative state after reconnect/sequence gaps.
- Clearly distinguish PAPER/SEMI/FULL and stale/healthy states.
- HALT and FLATTEN ALL are separate actions; FLATTEN ALL requires strong confirmation.
- Never put private exchange secrets in browser code, `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, localStorage, or logs.
- Keep API/WebSocket types aligned with @docs/10_REST_API.md.
- Use shadcn/ui + Tailwind and accessible status semantics.
- Run repository frontend lint/typecheck/tests/build before completing relevant changes.
